mdl-demo CLI console: you are www-data, in a session that outlives this window.
The source code in demo/ is editable: change Moodle and its plugins however you like,
but things may break. Reset the site to get a clean copy. Backups don't include your
code changes.

Run claude-install, then claude, and sign in with your own account. Ask it for what
you need: sample data, adding a private plugin, fixing a bug in the code.
To continue from claude.ai/code or your phone, run "claude remote-control" instead.

Your Claude login is stored in your home directory, where any PHP on this site can
read it. Run `claude auth logout` before trying untrusted plugins or deleting this demo.

Select with the mouse, Ctrl+C copies, Ctrl+V pastes.
For a fresh session, press Ctrl+D until Reconnect appears, then click it.

